ed=\"true\" aria-controls=\"_R_2ehav5uaivbH1_\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col text-start\"><span data-open=\"true\" data-slot=\"title\" class=\"text-[18px] lg:text-[19px] font-semibold text-black\">What is BIMM?</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-open=\"true\" data-slot=\"indicator\" class=\"transition-transform rotate-0 data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 rtl:-rotate-180 rtl:data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 text-black\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1em\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M15.5 19l-7-7 7-7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></button></h2><section style=\"will-change:auto;opacity:1;height:auto;overflow-y:unset\"><div data-open=\"true\" data-slot=\"content\" class=\"py-2 pt-0 pb-[16px] text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] font-normal leading-[1.33] lg:leading-[1.41] tracking-[-0.32px] lg:tracking-[-0.36px] text-black\" id=\"_R_2ehav5uaivbH1_\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"_R_2ehav5uaivb_\">BIMM is an app that gives you access to exclusive deals and offers at restaurants and cafes. Just subscribe, browse deals near you, and save on every meal.</div></section></div><div data-slot=\"base\" class=\"bg-white rounded-[12px] px-[16px] py-0 shadow-none group-[.is-splitted]:shadow-none\" aria-label=\"How does BIMM work?\"><h2 data-slot=\"heading\"><button data-slot=\"trigger\" class=\"flex w-full h-full items-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 transition-opacity py-[16px] gap-[8px]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" id=\"_R_2mhav5uaivb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-c26141e2e942\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col text-start\"><span data-slot=\"title\" class=\"text-[18px] lg:text-[19px] font-semibold text-black\">How does BIMM work?</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"indicator\" class=\"transition-transform rotate-0 data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 rtl:-rotate-180 rtl:data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 text-black\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1em\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M15.5 19l-7-7 7-7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></button></h2><div hidden id=\"faq-c26141e2e942\" class=\"py-2 pb-[16px] text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] text-black\" role=\"region\">Download the app, enable subscription, and start browsing deals. When you find one you like, book it for a date and time, then show up and swipe to check in — it&#x27;s that simple.</div></div><div data-slot=\"base\" class=\"bg-white rounded-[12px] px-[16px] py-0 shadow-none group-[.is-splitted]:shadow-none\" aria-label=\"How much does BIMM cost?\"><h2 data-slot=\"heading\"><button data-slot=\"trigger\" class=\"flex w-full h-full items-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 transition-opacity py-[16px] gap-[8px]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" id=\"_R_2uhav5uaivb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-4b0e970a9312\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col text-start\"><span data-slot=\"title\" class=\"text-[18px] lg:text-[19px] font-semibold text-black\">How much does BIMM cost?</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"indicator\" class=\"transition-transform rotate-0 data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 rtl:-rotate-180 rtl:data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 text-black\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1em\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M15.5 19l-7-7 7-7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></button></h2><div hidden id=\"faq-4b0e970a9312\" class=\"py-2 pb-[16px] text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] text-black\" role=\"region\">Loyalty cards are free, but you&#x27;ll need to pay for the subscription to get access to Deals. Premium costs 49 NOK a month, or 295 NOK a year (24.58 NOK/month) — both with a 7-day free trial. You can cancel at any time.</div></div><div data-slot=\"base\" class=\"bg-white rounded-[12px] px-[16px] py-0 shadow-none group-[.is-splitted]:shadow-none\" aria-label=\"Can I cancel my subscription?\"><h2 data-slot=\"heading\"><button data-slot=\"trigger\" class=\"flex w-full h-full items-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 transition-opacity py-[16px] gap-[8px]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" id=\"_R_36hav5uaivb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-c6b8a6443cbf\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col text-start\"><span data-slot=\"title\" class=\"text-[18px] lg:text-[19px] font-semibold text-black\">Can I cancel my subscription?</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"indicator\" class=\"transition-transform rotate-0 data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 rtl:-rotate-180 rtl:data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 text-black\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1em\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M15.5 19l-7-7 7-7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></button></h2><div hidden id=\"faq-c6b8a6443cbf\" class=\"py-2 pb-[16px] text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] text-black\" role=\"region\">Yes, you can cancel anytime. Your access stays active until the end of your current billing period — no hidden fees or cancellation penalties.</div></div><div data-slot=\"base\" class=\"bg-white rounded-[12px] px-[16px] py-0 shadow-none group-[.is-splitted]:shadow-none\" aria-label=\"How do I redeem a deal?\"><h2 data-slot=\"heading\"><button data-slot=\"trigger\" class=\"flex w-full h-full items-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 transition-opacity py-[16px] gap-[8px]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" id=\"_R_3ehav5uaivb_\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"faq-229e0b4565f8\"><div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col text-start\"><span data-slot=\"title\" class=\"text-[18px] lg:text-[19px] font-semibold text-black\">How do I redeem a deal?</span></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" data-slot=\"indicator\" class=\"transition-transform rotate-0 data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 rtl:-rotate-180 rtl:data-[open=true]:-rotate-90 text-black\"><svg aria-hidden=\"true\" fill=\"none\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"1em\" role=\"presentation\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"1em\"><path d=\"M15.5 19l-7-7 7-7\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path></svg></span></button></h2><div hidden id=\"faq-229e0b4565f8\" class=\"py-2 pb-[16px] text-[16px] lg:text-[18px] text-black\" role=\"region\">Open the BIMM app, find a deal you want, and book it for a date and time. At the venue, swipe to check in and show it to the staff.</div></div><div data-slot=\"base\" class=\"bg-white rounded-[12px] px-[16px] py-0 shadow-none group-[.is-splitted]:shadow-none\" aria-label=\"Who is behind BIMM?\"><h2 data-slot=\"heading\"><button data-slot=\"trigger\" class=\"flex w-full h-full items-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus